<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\東京駅.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "5000" "PASS"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\背景\さわ長城駅.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>"Made it at last. It's been a while since I came to <STYLE ID="1" RUBY="みなかみ">Minakami</STYLE> City. 
{PAUSE ""}
But maybe I got here a little early. There's still a whole hour until my appointment with the professor..."<PG>
"I'll go into a cafe or something."<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE" "5000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "イエローカメラ.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\背景\カフェ外装.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"Ooh, the famous cafe chain, Ben's Coffee!
{PAUSE ""}
　Of course, there isn't one in Motoki-cho yet. 
{PAUSE ""}
Okay, let's go in!"<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\風呂ドア.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\背景\カフェ内装.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Welcome. Please go ahead if you've decided on your order."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Um, a cafe latte, please."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"What size would you like?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"The sizes are... 
{PAUSE ""}
um, Pequeno, 
{PAUSE ""}
Medio, 
{PAUSE ""}
Grande, 
{PAUSE ""}
Oversized...?
{PAUSE ""}
　Oh, these are Portuguese for small, medium, large, extra-large. 
{PAUSE ""}
Um, Medio, please!"<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\背景\カフェラテ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"Yeah, well, the taste is nothing special either way."<PG>
"I'll go over my materials again while I've got the chance."<PG>
"............
{PAUSE ""}
............
{PAUSE ""}
............"<PG>
"Why is it... I can't concentrate... 
{PAUSE ""}
Maybe it's because I'm not used to this atmosphere..."<PG>
"<STYLE ID="3">Kogori-senpai</STYLE>... Is she all right...? 
{PAUSE ""}
Should I give her a call...? 
{PAUSE ""}
No, but if she's asleep, I'd wake her up..."<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Huh? </STYLE>Goto-san<STYLE ID="2">?"</STYLE>
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\ファミレス.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "900" "3000" "PASS"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\背景\カフェ内装.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"Oh, Professor, good morning."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE>Goto-san<STYLE ID="2">, you were here too?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Yes, I got here a little early."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"How are you feeling? Think you'll be okay?"</STYLE><PG>
"Yes, I'm in perfect shape!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"I see. Well, </STYLE>Goto-san<STYLE ID="2">, the professors seem to have high hopes for your presentation. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Ah, sorry, was that too much pressure?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"No... 
{PAUSE ""}
If people didn't expect that much of me, it wouldn't be worth doing..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE>Goto-san<STYLE ID="2">, are you okay? You seem kind of down."</STYLE><PG>
"Do I... 
{PAUSE ""}
Ahaha! I guess I really am a little nervous!?
{PAUSE ""}
　U-um, let's do the final check!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"All right."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"And so, regarding unapproved drugs going forward... 
{PAUSE ""}
um... 
{PAUSE ""}
Huh? What was it?"<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\背景\カフェ内装.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"In Japan in particular, the delay in drug approval... 
{PAUSE ""}
Jik-ken...?
{PAUSE ""}
　Huh? How do you read this kanji again...?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4" RUBY="ちけん">Clinical trials</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, maybe?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Oh, right, chiken―clinical trials. 
{PAUSE ""}
Recruiting participants for clinical trials... 
{PAUSE ""}
um..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE>Goto-san<STYLE ID="2">, are you really okay?"</STYLE><PG>
"I'm... 
{PAUSE ""}
fine..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"............"</STYLE><PG>
"Professor... uh..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Hm?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Professor, I'm sorry! I'm going home after all!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Wait, </STYLE>Goto-san<STYLE ID="2">!?"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE" "1000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\風呂ドア.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{PLAYSND "SE\アスファルトダッシュ.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
"No, I can't leave <STYLE ID="3">Kogori-senpai</STYLE> alone after all...!
{PAUSE ""}
　<STYLE ID="3">Kogori-senpai</STYLE> is in a really bad way...!
{PAUSE ""}
　But... what am I supposed to say to <STYLE ID="3">Senpai</STYLE>...!?"
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "3000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<PG>
{}
